      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just hard because i feel like my art used to have this spark, but now it's just... gone. i feel like i'm just a shell, and maybe that's the point of the song i'm writing. i want to explore the idea that maybe the only way to truly express something pure is to reach that absolute limit, where there's nothing left to lose. does that even make sense? or am i just being dramatic?",
